                 "width":33.3333333333333,
                 "x":1991.33333333333,
                 "y":861
                }, 
                {
                 "height":33.25,
                 "id":39,
                 "name":"Normandie Incubation (2018-2019)",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"icon",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"building_ni"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey worked at Normandie Incubation as an Assistant Project Officer, supporting entrepreneurs as they developed their projects and explored the early stages of venture creation. This role gave him direct exposure to startup support and allowed him to work closely with project holders as they turned ideas into more structured initiatives.\nDuring this time, he also helped set up a mentorship program, created internal tools to improve the team\u2019s work, and led workshops for entrepreneurs. Through this experience, he developed strong foundations in startup support, program coordination, and workshop facilitation."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey a travaill\u00e9 chez Normandie Incubation en tant qu\u2019assistant charg\u00e9 de projet, o\u00f9 il a accompagn\u00e9 des entrepreneurs dans le d\u00e9veloppement de leurs projets et les a aid\u00e9s \u00e0 franchir les premi\u00e8res \u00e9tapes de la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019entreprise. Ce poste lui a permis de se familiariser directement avec l\u2019accompagnement des start-ups et de collaborer \u00e9troitement avec les porteurs de projets pour les aider \u00e0 transformer leurs id\u00e9es en initiatives plus structur\u00e9es.\nAu cours de cette p\u00e9riode, il a \u00e9galement contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 la mise en place d\u2019un programme de mentorat, cr\u00e9\u00e9 des outils internes pour am\u00e9liorer le travail de l\u2019\u00e9quipe et anim\u00e9 des ateliers destin\u00e9s aux entrepreneurs. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 cette exp\u00e9rience, il a acquis de solides bases dans l'accompagnement des start-ups, la coordination de programmes et l'animation d'ateliers."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"title",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Normandie Incubation (2018-2019)"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"experience"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"experience",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":62,
                 "x":928.5,
                 "y":302.5
                }, 
                {
                 "height":31.75,
                 "id":40,
                 "name":"Bureau de Prod. (2019-2020)",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"icon",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"building_bdp"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey worked at Bureau de Prod as a Project Manager and Graphic Designer. In this role, he contributed to a wide range of creative and digital projects, combining project coordination with hands-on design work.\nHe was involved in the creation of brand identities from early concept to final delivery, including logos, social media banners, visual assets, and web design. He also developed social media content from ideation to publication, creating both the visuals and the overall communication materials.\nIn addition, he worked on the creation of websites using platforms such as Magento, WordPress, Wix, and Squarespace, while also designing a variety of visual communication tools including flyers, banners, and other branding materials.\nDuring his time there, the company grew from 3 employees to 8, giving him the opportunity to evolve alongside a fast-growing creative business and gain hands-on experience in a dynamic entrepreneurial environment."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey a travaill\u00e9 chez Bureau de Prod en tant que chef de projet et graphiste. \u00c0 ce poste, il a contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 un large \u00e9ventail de projets cr\u00e9atifs et num\u00e9riques, alliant la coordination de projets \u00e0 un travail de conception pratique.\nIl a particip\u00e9 \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019identit\u00e9s de marque, de la conception initiale \u00e0 la livraison finale, notamment en concevant des logos, des banni\u00e8res pour les r\u00e9seaux sociaux, des ressources visuelles et des sites web. Il a \u00e9galement d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 du contenu pour les r\u00e9seaux sociaux, de la conception \u00e0 la publication, en cr\u00e9ant \u00e0 la fois les visuels et l'ensemble des supports de communication.\nDe plus, il a travaill\u00e9 \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation de sites web \u00e0 l'aide de plateformes telles que Magento, WordPress, Wix et Squarespace, tout en concevant divers outils de communication visuelle, notamment des flyers, des banni\u00e8res et d'autres supports de marque. Au cours de son passage dans cette entreprise, celle-ci est pass\u00e9e de 3 \u00e0 8 employ\u00e9s, ce qui lui a permis d'\u00e9voluer aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s d'une entreprise cr\u00e9ative en pleine croissance et d'acqu\u00e9rir une exp\u00e9rience pratique dans un environnement entrepreneurial dynamique."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"title",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Bureau de Prod. (2019-2020)"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"experience"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"experience",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":64.25,
                 "x":1088,
                 "y":303.5
                }, 
                {
                 "height":31.5,
                 "id":41,
                 "name":"P\u00e9pite Etena (2021-2022)",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"icon",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"building_etena"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey worked at P\u00e9pite ETENA for 18 months, supporting student entrepreneurs across Alsace. In this role, he designed and implemented support programs while mentoring around 35 students each year as they developed their entrepreneurial ideas into more concrete projects.\nBeyond direct mentoring, he organized and led events dedicated to student entrepreneurship, managed the coaching and support team, and contributed to the promotion of entrepreneurship across the region. This experience allowed him to combine mentoring, program coordination, communication, and event management in order to help students move from ideas to action.\nHe also created a gamified entrepreneurship challenge that allowed students to experience the life of an entrepreneur for a day. The event is still organized several times each year and brings together more than 250 students to take part in different challenges.\nIn addition, he contributed to the organization of Startup Weekend Mulhouse."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey a travaill\u00e9 chez P\u00e9pite ETENA pendant 18 mois, o\u00f9 il a accompagn\u00e9 des \u00e9tudiants entrepreneurs dans toute l'Alsace. \u00c0 ce poste, il a con\u00e7u et mis en \u0153uvre des programmes d'accompagnement tout en encadrant environ 35 \u00e9tudiants chaque ann\u00e9e, les aidant \u00e0 transformer leurs id\u00e9es entrepreneuriales en projets plus concrets.\nAu-del\u00e0 de l'accompagnement direct, il a organis\u00e9 et anim\u00e9 des \u00e9v\u00e9nements consacr\u00e9s \u00e0 l'entrepreneuriat \u00e9tudiant, g\u00e9r\u00e9 l'\u00e9quipe de coaching et d'accompagnement, et contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 la promotion de l'entrepreneuriat dans toute la r\u00e9gion. Cette exp\u00e9rience lui a permis de combiner mentorat, coordination de programmes, communication et gestion d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements afin d'aider les \u00e9tudiants \u00e0 passer de l'id\u00e9e \u00e0 l'action.\nIl a \u00e9galement cr\u00e9\u00e9 un challenge entrepreneurial ludique permettant aux \u00e9tudiants de d\u00e9couvrir la vie d'un entrepreneur le temps d'une journ\u00e9e. Cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement est toujours organis\u00e9 plusieurs fois par an et rassemble plus de 250 \u00e9tudiants qui participent \u00e0 diff\u00e9rents d\u00e9fis.\nDe plus, il a contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 l'organisation du Startup Weekend Mulhouse."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"title",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"P\u00e9pite Etena (2021-2022)"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"experience"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"experience",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":63,
                 "x":1248.5,
                 "y":303.75
                }, 
                {
                 "height":31.8333333333333,
                 "id":42,
                 "name":"Centech (2023-2025)",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"icon",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"building_centech"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey worked at Centech as Startup Program Manager, where he supported more than 200 startups in deeptech, medtech, and edtech. Ranked among the world\u2019s top 10 university business incubators by UBI Global, Centech offered him the opportunity to work closely with high-potential technology ventures and contribute to a leading innovation ecosystem in North America.\nIn this role, he guided startups from ideation to commercialization while helping design and manage world-class incubation and acceleration programs. He worked to ensure a strong experience for entrepreneurs at every stage of their journey, while maintaining high-quality program content aligned with international best practices.\nHe also oversaw the smooth delivery of both two-year incubation programs and 12-week acceleration programs, managed a diverse team of coaches, mentors, and advisors, and developed tools and platforms to improve the startup experience. Through this role, he strengthened his expertise in program design, founder support, and ecosystem building."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey a travaill\u00e9 chez Centech en tant que responsable du programme de soutien aux start-ups, o\u00f9 il a accompagn\u00e9 plus de 200 start-ups dans les domaines de la deep tech, de la medtech et de l'edtech. Class\u00e9 parmi les 10 meilleurs incubateurs universitaires au monde par UBI Global, Centech lui a offert l'opportunit\u00e9 de travailler en \u00e9troite collaboration avec des entreprises technologiques \u00e0 fort potentiel et de contribuer \u00e0 un \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me d'innovation de premier plan en Am\u00e9rique du Nord. Il s\u2019est attach\u00e9 \u00e0 garantir une exp\u00e9rience enrichissante aux entrepreneurs \u00e0 chaque \u00e9tape de leur parcours, tout en veillant \u00e0 ce que le contenu des programmes reste de haute qualit\u00e9 et conforme aux meilleures pratiques internationales.\nIl a \u00e9galement supervis\u00e9 le bon d\u00e9roulement des programmes d\u2019incubation de deux ans et des programmes d\u2019acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration de 12 semaines, dirig\u00e9 une \u00e9quipe diversifi\u00e9e de coaches, de mentors et de conseillers, et d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 des outils et des plateformes visant \u00e0 am\u00e9liorer l\u2019exp\u00e9rience des start-ups. Ce poste lui a permis de renforcer son expertise en mati\u00e8re de conception de programmes, d\u2019accompagnement des fondateurs et de cr\u00e9ation d\u2019\u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"title",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Centech (2023-2025)"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"experience"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"experience",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":64.8333333333335,
                 "x":1407.58333333333,
                 "y":304.25
                }, 
                {
                 "height":9,
                 "id":45,
                 "name":"Morgane Paviost",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"morgane"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the pleasure of working alongside Geoffrey Poincheval for two years, collaborating on the development of startup support programs. Geoffrey is an outstanding professional, combining a calm and composed approach with sharp analytical skills. His ability to assess complex challenges and provide clear, strategic insights has been invaluable.\nBeyond his analytical expertise, Geoffrey is a highly proactive and collaborative team member. He fosters a positive and efficient work environment, always seeking solutions that align with both operational goals and the needs of the startups we supported. His capacity to engage with stakeholders and drive meaningful progress makes him an asset to any team.\nI highly recommend Geoffrey to any organization looking for a dedicated and insightful professional who excels in both strategic thinking and teamwork."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu le plaisir de travailler aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de Geoffrey Poincheval pendant deux ans, dans le cadre de la mise en place de programmes d'accompagnement des start-ups. Geoffrey est un professionnel hors pair, alliant un calme et une s\u00e9r\u00e9nit\u00e9 de nature \u00e0 un esprit d'analyse tr\u00e8s aff\u00fbt\u00e9. Sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 \u00e9valuer des d\u00e9fis complexes et \u00e0 proposer des perspectives claires et strat\u00e9giques s'est av\u00e9r\u00e9e inestimable.\nAu-del\u00e0 de son expertise analytique, Geoffrey est un collaborateur extr\u00eamement proactif et soucieux du travail d'\u00e9quipe. Il favorise un environnement de travail positif et efficace, recherchant toujours des solutions qui concilient \u00e0 la fois les objectifs op\u00e9rationnels et les besoins des start-ups que nous avons accompagn\u00e9es. Sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 dialoguer avec les parties prenantes et \u00e0 g\u00e9n\u00e9rer des avanc\u00e9es significatives fait de lui un atout pour n\u2019importe quelle \u00e9quipe.\nJe recommande vivement Geoffrey \u00e0 toute organisation \u00e0 la recherche d\u2019un professionnel d\u00e9vou\u00e9 et perspicace, excellant tant dans la r\u00e9flexion strat\u00e9gique que dans le travail d\u2019\u00e9quipe."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":9,
                 "x":881.75,
                 "y":1314.75
                }, 
                {
                 "height":10.25,
                 "id":46,
                 "name":"Doryne Bourque",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"doryne"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the pleasure of working with Geoffrey Poincheval at Centech, where he played a key role in supporting startups in the acceleration phase. His calm demeanor, sensitivity, and keen listening skills make him a valuable ally for entrepreneurs, offering them a structured framework while stimulating their creativity.\nGeoffrey has in-depth knowledge of innovation ecosystems and knows how to navigate between strategy and execution. He excels at facilitating workshops and implementing concrete solutions that address the challenges faced by startups, with a pragmatic, innovative, and human approach.\nHis adaptability and natural leadership have made him a pillar of Centech, recognized by his peers and the entrepreneurs he supports. Working with him has been a most rewarding experience, and I recommend Geoffrey without hesitation to any organization seeking an innovation expert who combines vision, rigor, and exceptional interpersonal skills."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu le plaisir de travailler avec Geoffrey Poincheval chez Centech, o\u00f9 il a jou\u00e9 un r\u00f4le cl\u00e9 dans l'accompagnement des startups en phase d'acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration. Son calme, sa sensibilit\u00e9 et son \u00e9coute attentive font de lui un alli\u00e9 pr\u00e9cieux pour les entrepreneurs, leur offrant un cadre structur\u00e9 tout en stimulant leur cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9.\nGeoffrey poss\u00e8de une connaissance approfondie des \u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes d'innovation et sait jongler entre strat\u00e9gie et mise en \u0153uvre. Il excelle dans l\u2019animation d\u2019ateliers et la mise en \u0153uvre de solutions concr\u00e8tes qui r\u00e9pondent aux d\u00e9fis rencontr\u00e9s par les startups, avec une approche pragmatique, innovante et humaine. Sa capacit\u00e9 d\u2019adaptation et son leadership naturel ont fait de lui un pilier de Centech, reconnu par ses pairs et les entrepreneurs qu\u2019il accompagne. Travailler avec lui a \u00e9t\u00e9 une exp\u00e9rience des plus enrichissantes, et je recommande sans h\u00e9sitation Geoffrey \u00e0 toute organisation \u00e0 la recherche d\u2019un expert en innovation alliant vision, rigueur et comp\u00e9tences relationnelles exceptionnelles."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":9.5,
                 "x":924.75,
                 "y":1287
                }, 
                {
                 "height":8.75,
                 "id":47,
                 "name":"Katya Guez",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"katya"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the pleasure to collaborate with Geoffrey as partner to support tech startups in Montreal's top incubator, Centech. Geoffrey's dedication, diligence and care to deliver the best programs to support startups was greatly appreciated by the entrepreneurs as contributors. As partners, we had the pleasure of working with Geoffrey who drove initiatives bringing ideas to life - such as introducing a sustainability workshop for Centech's cohorts. I strongly recommend Geoffrey!"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu le plaisir de collaborer avec Geoffrey en tant que partenaire pour accompagner les start-ups technologiques au sein de Centech, le premier incubateur de Montr\u00e9al. Son d\u00e9vouement, son s\u00e9rieux et son souci d'offrir les meilleurs programmes possibles pour soutenir les start-ups ont \u00e9t\u00e9 tr\u00e8s appr\u00e9ci\u00e9s tant par les entrepreneurs que par les contributeurs. En tant que partenaires, nous avons eu le plaisir de travailler avec Geoffrey, qui a men\u00e9 des initiatives permettant de concr\u00e9tiser des id\u00e9es, comme la mise en place d'un atelier sur le d\u00e9veloppement durable destin\u00e9 aux promotions de Centech. Je recommande vivement Geoffrey !"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":9.75,
                 "x":957.5,
                 "y":1316.5
                }, 
                {
                 "height":9.75,
                 "id":48,
                 "name":"Fran\u00e7ois Drolet",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"francois"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Working with Geoffrey has been a great experience all around! He is highly professional, he is performing well under pressure, always helpful and coming with solutions. He has been instrumental in many ways managing Centech's Acceleration program. We are all grateful for his contribution to the entire team and the startup community."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Travailler avec Geoffrey a \u00e9t\u00e9 une exp\u00e9rience formidable \u00e0 tous les \u00e9gards ! C'est un professionnel hors pair, qui sait rester performant m\u00eame sous pression, toujours pr\u00eat \u00e0 aider et \u00e0 proposer des solutions. Il a jou\u00e9 un r\u00f4le d\u00e9terminant \u00e0 bien des \u00e9gards dans la gestion du programme d'acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration de Centech. Nous lui sommes tous reconnaissants pour sa contribution \u00e0 l'ensemble de l'\u00e9quipe et \u00e0 la communaut\u00e9 des start-ups."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":9.5,
                 "x":1023.5,
                 "y":1312.5
                }, 
                {
                 "height":10.25,
                 "id":49,
                 "name":"Louis-Pierre Charest",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"louis-pierre"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I loved working with Geoffrey. In addition to demonstrating unwavering composure, he always impressed me with his creativity, independence, and curiosity. I am proud to have had him as one of our employees.\nThank you, Geoffrey. You will always be welcome here!"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai beaucoup appr\u00e9ci\u00e9 travailler avec Geoffrey. Outre son sang-froid \u00e0 toute \u00e9preuve, il m'a toujours impressionn\u00e9 par sa cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9, son autonomie et sa curiosit\u00e9. Je suis fier de l'avoir compt\u00e9 parmi nos collaborateurs.\nMerci, Geoffrey. Tu seras toujours le bienvenu ici !"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":10.75,
                 "x":1503.75,
                 "y":1313
                }, 
                {
                 "height":8.25,
                 "id":50,
                 "name":"Marjorick Foisy",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"marjorick"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Recruiting Geoffrey to our team was a wise decision. With his exceptional team spirit, he is not only a pleasant colleague but also extremely professional. Geoffrey has made significant improvements to our core programs at Centech, which are dedicated to supporting entrepreneurs. I have observed his dynamism, his ability to listen actively, and his commitment to providing superior service. I recommend him without hesitation!\nBy the way, I also heard that there is a hidden room somewhere but I have never seen it."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Recruter Geoffrey au sein de notre \u00e9quipe a \u00e9t\u00e9 une sage d\u00e9cision. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son esprit d'\u00e9quipe exceptionnel, c'est non seulement un coll\u00e8gue agr\u00e9able, mais aussi un professionnel hors pair. Geoffrey a apport\u00e9 des am\u00e9liorations significatives \u00e0 nos programmes phares chez Centech, qui visent \u00e0 soutenir les entrepreneurs. J'ai pu constater son dynamisme, sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 \u00e9couter activement et son engagement \u00e0 offrir un service de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure. Je le recommande sans h\u00e9sitation !\nAu fait, j'ai aussi entendu dire qu'il y avait une pi\u00e8ce secr\u00e8te quelque part, mais je ne l'ai jamais vue."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":9,
                 "x":1108.25,
                 "y":1316.25
                }, 
                {
                 "height":7.25,
                 "id":51,
                 "name":"M\u00e9lanie St-Onge",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"melanie"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the opportunity to work with Geoffrey at Centech Mtl, and his expertise makes all the difference for the entrepreneurs he supports. He knows how to ask the right questions, challenge with kindness, and offer advice tailored to the real challenges faced by startups.\nHis structured and strategic approach helps founders transform their ideas into solid, scalable businesses. He is also attentive, open to new ideas, and always looking for innovative and concrete solutions.\nIf you are looking for someone to structure an incubation program, support entrepreneurs, or propel a product development initiative, Geoffrey is the ideal person. His impact on innovation and entrepreneurship is undeniable."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu l'occasion de travailler avec Geoffrey chez Centech Mtl, et son expertise fait toute la diff\u00e9rence pour les entrepreneurs qu'il accompagne. Il sait poser les bonnes questions, remettre en question avec bienveillance et offrir des conseils adapt\u00e9s aux d\u00e9fis concrets auxquels sont confront\u00e9es les start-ups.\nSon approche structur\u00e9e et strat\u00e9gique aide les fondateurs \u00e0 transformer leurs id\u00e9es en entreprises solides et \u00e9volutives. Il est \u00e9galement attentif, ouvert aux nouvelles id\u00e9es et toujours \u00e0 la recherche de solutions innovantes et concr\u00e8tes.\nSi vous cherchez quelqu\u2019un pour structurer un programme d\u2019incubation, accompagner des entrepreneurs ou faire avancer une initiative de d\u00e9veloppement de produit, Geoffrey est la personne id\u00e9ale. Son impact sur l\u2019innovation et l\u2019entrepreneuriat est ind\u00e9niable."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":8.25,
                 "x":1468.25,
                 "y":1288.25
                }, 
                {
                 "height":9,
                 "id":52,
                 "name":"Ruben Lopez",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"ruben"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey is one of the most energetic and results-driven professionals I've had the pleasure of working with. He takes initiative, moves things forward, and is always highly responsive. From Nanofacile's early stages, he has been our go-to person for support, making a meaningful impact on our journey. I look forward to working with him again in the near future."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey est l'un des professionnels les plus dynamiques et les plus ax\u00e9s sur les r\u00e9sultats avec lesquels j'ai eu le plaisir de travailler. Il fait preuve d'initiative, fait avancer les choses et se montre toujours tr\u00e8s r\u00e9actif. Depuis les d\u00e9buts de Nanofacile, il a \u00e9t\u00e9 notre interlocuteur privil\u00e9gi\u00e9 pour tout ce qui concerne l'assistance, et a jou\u00e9 un r\u00f4le d\u00e9terminant dans notre parcours. Je me r\u00e9jouis de retravailler avec lui tr\u00e8s prochainement."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":9.5,
                 "x":1432.25,
                 "y":1312.25
                }, 
                {
                 "height":8.25,
                 "id":53,
                 "name":"Caroline Chevrier",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"caroline"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the pleasure of working with Geoffrey at Centech, and I was impressed by his ability to turn complex challenges into concrete opportunities. Rigorous and extremely efficient, he is a valuable asset. Organized, meticulous, and collaborative, Geoffrey has a great ability to adapt to his environment and possesses a desire to always go further. It was a great pleasure to work with him on the implementation of the ESG program, and his support was invaluable during the leadership of acceleration cohorts."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu le plaisir de travailler avec Geoffrey chez Centech, et j'ai \u00e9t\u00e9 impressionn\u00e9 par sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 transformer des d\u00e9fis complexes en opportunit\u00e9s concr\u00e8tes. Rigoureux et extr\u00eamement efficace, c'est un atout pr\u00e9cieux. Organis\u00e9, m\u00e9ticuleux et collaboratif, Geoffrey fait preuve d'une grande capacit\u00e9 d'adaptation \u00e0 son environnement et d'une volont\u00e9 de toujours aller plus loin. Ce fut un grand plaisir de travailler avec lui \u00e0 la mise en \u0153uvre du programme ESG, et son soutien a \u00e9t\u00e9 inestimable lors de l'animation des cohortes d'acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":8,
                 "x":1069.25,
                 "y":1290.75
                }, 
                {
                 "height":6.75,
                 "id":54,
                 "name":"Samuel Pelletier",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"samuel"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the pleasure of working with Geoffrey during my time as a startup founder at the startup incubator Centech, where he was the cohort manager. From day one, it was clear how deeply dedicated he is to the startup ecosystem. His commitment showed not only in how smoothly the program ran but also in the way he genuinely cared about the growth of each team.\nGeoffrey brings an impressive level of organization and attention to detail to everything he does. Yet, what stood out the most to me was his ability to strike the right balance between pragmatism and a human touch. He's solution-oriented, but never at the expense of empathy or approachability. That rare mix made a real difference during fast-paced, high-stakes moments in the cohort."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu le plaisir de travailler avec Geoffrey lorsque j'\u00e9tais fondateur d'une start-up au sein de l'incubateur Centech, o\u00f9 il occupait le poste de responsable de promotion. D\u00e8s le premier jour, son engagement profond envers l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me des start-ups \u00e9tait \u00e9vident. Cet engagement se manifestait non seulement par le bon d\u00e9roulement du programme, mais aussi par l'attention sinc\u00e8re qu'il portait \u00e0 l'\u00e9panouissement de chaque \u00e9quipe.\nGeoffrey fait preuve d'un sens de l'organisation et d'un souci du d\u00e9tail impressionnants dans tout ce qu'il entreprend. Mais ce qui m'a le plus marqu\u00e9, c'est sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 trouver le juste \u00e9quilibre entre pragmatisme et humanit\u00e9. Il est orient\u00e9 vers les solutions, mais jamais au d\u00e9triment de l'empathie ou de l'accessibilit\u00e9. Ce m\u00e9lange rare a fait toute la diff\u00e9rence lors des moments intenses et d\u00e9cisifs au sein de la promotion."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":8.25,
                 "x":1326,
                 "y":1287.25
                }, 
                {
                 "height":25.75,
                 "id":55,
                 "name":"Centech recommandation letter",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"To whom it may concern,\nIt is with great pleasure that I recommend Geoffrey Poincheval, who worked with us at Centech as a Program Manager from January 2023 to January 2025. As General Director, I had the opportunity to witness Geoffrey\u2019s exceptional contribution to our mission of supporting deeptech startups and advancing innovation at the intersection of academia and entrepreneurship.\nCentech is ranked among the top 10 university-affiliated incubators worldwide and Geoffrey quickly established himself as a trusted and proactive leader within that environment. Over two years, he supported more than 200 startups, guiding them through critical phases of their development with a rare combination of strategic thinking, empathy, and operational discipline. He played a key role in redesigning our acceleration program, bringing in fresh ideas while aligning with founder needs and market realities. The result was a significantly improved experience for the startups and stronger outcomes.\nGeoffrey also led the organization of numerous events, from pitch sessions to investor meetings, helping to build and energize our ecosystem. What truly sets him apart, however, is his ability to challenge the status quo constructively. He brings curiosity, creativity, and courage to every conversation - never for the sake of disruption, but always with the intent to make things better.\nA highly autonomous and collaborative professional, Geoffrey navigated cross-functional dynamics with ease and was respected by colleagues, founders, and partners alike. His leadership, adaptability, and dedication made him an invaluable asset to our team.\nAny organization focused on innovation and entrepreneurship would be lucky to have him. I wholeheartedly recommend Geoffrey for any opportunity where ambition, initiative, and impact matter.\nSincerely,\nMarjorick Foisy"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"\u00c0 qui de droit,\nC'est avec grand plaisir que je recommande Geoffrey Poincheval, qui a travaill\u00e9 avec nous chez Centech en tant que responsable de programme de janvier 2023 \u00e0 janvier 2025. En tant que directeur g\u00e9n\u00e9ral, j\u2019ai eu l\u2019occasion d\u2019\u00eatre t\u00e9moin de la contribution exceptionnelle de Geoffrey \u00e0 notre mission, qui consiste \u00e0 soutenir les start-ups deep tech et \u00e0 faire progresser l\u2019innovation \u00e0 la crois\u00e9e du monde universitaire et de l\u2019entrepreneuriat.\nCentech figure parmi les 10 meilleurs incubateurs universitaires au monde et Geoffrey s\u2019est rapidement impos\u00e9 comme un leader de confiance et proactif au sein de cet environnement. En deux ans, il a accompagn\u00e9 plus de 200 start-ups, les guidant \u00e0 travers les phases critiques de leur d\u00e9veloppement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une combinaison rare de r\u00e9flexion strat\u00e9gique, d\u2019empathie et de rigueur op\u00e9rationnelle. Il a jou\u00e9 un r\u00f4le cl\u00e9 dans la refonte de notre programme d\u2019acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration, en apportant des id\u00e9es novatrices tout en s\u2019alignant sur les besoins des fondateurs et les r\u00e9alit\u00e9s du march\u00e9. Il en a r\u00e9sult\u00e9 une exp\u00e9rience nettement am\u00e9lior\u00e9e pour les start-ups et des r\u00e9sultats plus solides.\nGeoffrey a \u00e9galement dirig\u00e9 l'organisation de nombreux \u00e9v\u00e9nements, allant des sessions de pr\u00e9sentation aux r\u00e9unions avec les investisseurs, contribuant ainsi \u00e0 d\u00e9velopper et \u00e0 dynamiser notre \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me. Ce qui le distingue v\u00e9ritablement, cependant, c'est sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 remettre en question le statu quo de mani\u00e8re constructive. Il apporte curiosit\u00e9, cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et courage \u00e0 chaque conversation \u2013 jamais dans le but de semer le trouble, mais toujours avec l'intention d'am\u00e9liorer les choses. Professionnel \u00e0 la fois tr\u00e8s autonome et collaboratif, Geoffrey a su naviguer avec aisance dans les dynamiques interfonctionnelles et \u00e9tait respect\u00e9 tant par ses coll\u00e8gues que par les fondateurs et les partenaires. Son leadership, sa capacit\u00e9 d'adaptation et son d\u00e9vouement ont fait de lui un atout inestimable pour notre \u00e9quipe. Toute organisation ax\u00e9e sur l'innovation et l'entrepreneuriat aurait de la chance de l'avoir parmi ses rangs. Je recommande sans r\u00e9serve Geoffrey pour toute opportunit\u00e9 o\u00f9 l'ambition, l'initiative et l'impact sont essentiels. Cordialement, Marjorick Foisy"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"recommandation"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"recommandation",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":25.75,
                 "x":1187.5,
                 "y":1348.5
                }, 
                {
                 "height":9.75,
                 "id":56,
                 "name":"Gustavo Chelles",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"gustavo"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the opportunity of working with Geoffrey when we were accelerated by Centech, with our Lung Cancer Diagnostic project called Fujin. Geoffrey is not only a nice person to deal with, but showed to be a great program manager, genuinely focused on people success, integration and a good organization environment."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu l'occasion de travailler avec Geoffrey lorsque notre projet de diagnostic du cancer du poumon, baptis\u00e9 Fujin, a b\u00e9n\u00e9fici\u00e9 du programme d'acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration de Centech. Geoffrey est non seulement quelqu'un de tr\u00e8s agr\u00e9able, mais il s'est \u00e9galement r\u00e9v\u00e9l\u00e9 \u00eatre un excellent chef de projet, sinc\u00e8rement soucieux de la r\u00e9ussite de ses collaborateurs, de leur int\u00e9gration et de la cr\u00e9ation d'un environnement de travail favorable."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":8.75,
                 "x":1360.25,
                 "y":1314
                }, 
                {
                 "height":8.5,
                 "id":57,
                 "name":"Andr\u00e9 Lavigne",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"andr\u00e9"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey was one of my primary contacts at Centech. He was responsible for my workshops. I'm always ready, organized and there to help me. He made me feel like there were never any issues or problems. That means that he was caring, proactive and a real problem solver since I am well aware of the chal- lenges and logistics nightmare that came with his role.\nI can also confirm that there is a hidden room, i see it from here."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey \u00e9tait l'un de mes principaux interlocuteurs chez Centech. Il \u00e9tait responsable de mes ateliers. Il \u00e9tait toujours pr\u00eat, bien organis\u00e9 et disponible pour m'aider. Il m'a donn\u00e9 l'impression qu'il n'y avait jamais aucun souci ni aucun probl\u00e8me. Cela signifie qu'il \u00e9tait attentionn\u00e9, proactif et qu'il savait vraiment r\u00e9soudre les probl\u00e8mes, car je suis bien conscient des d\u00e9fis et du cauchemar logistique que comportait son poste.\nJe peux \u00e9galement confirmer qu'il y a une pi\u00e8ce secr\u00e8te, je la vois d'ici."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":8.25,
                 "x":1292.83333333333,
                 "y":1313.91666666667
                }, 
                {
                 "height":12.159090909091,
                 "id":58,
                 "name":"Ralph Fran\u00e7ois",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"ralph"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the opportunity to work with Geoffrey during my time at Centech, and his support was invaluable to me and to Reelcruit. His expertise in product strategy and business development, combined with his human and committed approach, made all the difference in our journey.\nGeoffrey knows how to ask the right questions, challenge entrepreneurs constructively, and provide essential strategic perspectives to accelerate a startup's growth. His support and vision have had a significant impact on our development.\nGeoffrey knows how to ask the right questions, challenge entrepreneurs in a constructive way, and provide essential strategic perspectives to accelerate the growth of a startup. His support and vision have had a significant impact on our development, and I am certain that he will bring the same added value to his future endeavors.\nI highly recommend him to any organization looking for an expert who is passionate about innovation and startup development!"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu l'occasion de travailler avec Geoffrey pendant mon passage chez Centech, et son soutien a \u00e9t\u00e9 inestimable pour moi et pour Reelcruit. Son expertise en strat\u00e9gie produit et en d\u00e9veloppement commercial, associ\u00e9e \u00e0 son approche humaine et engag\u00e9e, a fait toute la diff\u00e9rence dans notre parcours.\nGeoffrey sait poser les bonnes questions, mettre les entrepreneurs au d\u00e9fi de mani\u00e8re constructive et apporter des perspectives strat\u00e9giques essentielles pour acc\u00e9l\u00e9rer la croissance d'une start-up. Son soutien et sa vision ont eu un impact significatif sur notre d\u00e9veloppement.\nGeoffrey sait poser les bonnes questions, mettre les entrepreneurs au d\u00e9fi de mani\u00e8re constructive et apporter des perspectives strat\u00e9giques essentielles pour acc\u00e9l\u00e9rer la croissance d'une start-up. Son soutien et sa vision ont eu un impact significatif sur notre d\u00e9veloppement, et je suis certain qu'il apportera la m\u00eame valeur ajout\u00e9e \u00e0 ses futurs projets.\nJe le recommande vivement \u00e0 toute organisation \u00e0 la recherche d'un expert passionn\u00e9 par l'innovation et le d\u00e9veloppement des start-ups !"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":20.1363636363637,
                 "x":1479.22727272727,
                 "y":1189.54545454545
                }, 
                {
                 "height":15.9090909090908,
                 "id":59,
                 "name":"Carol-Ann Lemaire",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"carol-ann"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"I had the pleasure of working with Geoffrey and was impressed by his expertise and proactive approach. His support for startups is both strategic and human: he knows how to identify their needs and find the right players in the ecosystem to help them move forward effectively. It's the kind of collaboration we love: simple, effective, and dynamic. I would recommend him without hesitation to any organization looking for a committed and competent partner!"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"J'ai eu le plaisir de travailler avec Geoffrey et j'ai \u00e9t\u00e9 impressionn\u00e9 par son expertise et son approche proactive. Son accompagnement des start-ups est \u00e0 la fois strat\u00e9gique et humain : il sait identifier leurs besoins et trouver les bons acteurs au sein de l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me pour les aider \u00e0 aller de l'avant efficacement. C'est le genre de collaboration que nous appr\u00e9cions : simple, efficace et dynamique. Je le recommanderais sans h\u00e9siter \u00e0 toute organisation \u00e0 la recherche d'un partenaire engag\u00e9 et comp\u00e9tent !"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":16.3636363636365,
                 "x":1546.97727272727,
                 "y":1218.86363636364
                }, 
                {
                 "height":18.1666666666667,
                 "id":60,
                 "name":"Patricia Girard",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"patricia"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey was the support person for my cohort at Centech. He was attentive, open to ideas, and very responsible. We could count on him, and he contributed greatly to our progress. His support made a real difference in our journey."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Geoffrey \u00e9tait le r\u00e9f\u00e9rent de notre promotion chez Centech. Il \u00e9tait \u00e0 l'\u00e9coute, ouvert aux id\u00e9es et tr\u00e8s responsable. Nous pouvions compter sur lui, et il a grandement contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 nos progr\u00e8s. Son soutien a vraiment fait la diff\u00e9rence tout au long de notre parcours."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":13.5833333333334,
                 "x":846.666666666667,
                 "y":1213.58333333333
                }, 
                {
                 "height":15.25,
                 "id":61,
                 "name":"MJ",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"mj"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"We were truly saddened to learn of Geoffrey's involuntary departure from Quebec. His work, his attentiveness, and his ability to innovate left a lasting impression on our experience at Centech, and his absence was felt from the very first days.\nIt is largely thanks to his involvement that cybersecurity has found a strategic place in Centech's curriculum, both in teaching and during \u201cChallenge\u201d days. Geoffrey has been able to integrate this subject with intelligence and timing into an ever-evolving innovation ecosystem.\nWith his great listening skills, he has a keen understanding of innovation ecosystems and knows how to navigate between strategy and execution. Always available, he asks the right questions, offers relevant advice, and creates an environment of trust conducive to growth. His follow-ups are rigorous, and his interactions are always human\u2014a rare and valuable quality.\nGeoffrey is, quite simply, a gem to have on a team. We wish him success in finding a position that matches his talent and commitment.\nAnd if Montreal is still in his plans... we will be there, without hesitation."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Nous avons \u00e9t\u00e9 profond\u00e9ment attrist\u00e9s d'apprendre le d\u00e9part forc\u00e9 de Geoffrey du Qu\u00e9bec. Son travail, son \u00e9coute et sa capacit\u00e9 d'innovation ont marqu\u00e9 durablement notre exp\u00e9rience chez Centech, et son absence s'est fait sentir d\u00e8s les premiers jours.\nC'est en grande partie gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son implication que la cybers\u00e9curit\u00e9 a trouv\u00e9 une place strat\u00e9gique dans le programme de Centech, tant dans l'enseignement que lors des journ\u00e9es \u00ab Challenge \u00bb. Geoffrey a su int\u00e9grer ce sujet avec intelligence et au bon moment dans un \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me d\u2019innovation en constante \u00e9volution. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son grand sens de l\u2019\u00e9coute, il poss\u00e8de une compr\u00e9hension fine des \u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes d\u2019innovation et sait naviguer entre strat\u00e9gie et ex\u00e9cution. Toujours disponible, il pose les bonnes questions, offre des conseils pertinents et cr\u00e9e un climat de confiance propice \u00e0 la croissance. Son suivi est rigoureux et ses interactions sont toujours humaines \u2013 une qualit\u00e9 rare et pr\u00e9cieuse. Geoffrey est, tout simplement, un atout pr\u00e9cieux pour une \u00e9quipe. Nous lui souhaitons de trouver un poste \u00e0 la hauteur de son talent et de son engagement. Et si Montr\u00e9al figure toujours dans ses projets\u2026 nous serons l\u00e0, sans h\u00e9sitation."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":19,
                 "x":1366.5,
                 "y":1187.5
                }, 
                {
                 "height":12.25,
                 "id":62,
                 "name":"Jean-Luc Deschamps",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"jean-luc"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"During his (all too brief) time at Centech, Geoffrey significantly improved and advanced the two Centech programs offered to entrepreneurs. I witnessed his dynamism, his active listening skills, and his commitment to serving his clients well. I have no reservations in recommending him. Geoffrey has mastered two essential talents: know-how and interpersonal skills."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Au cours de son passage (bien trop bref) chez Centech, Geoffrey a consid\u00e9rablement am\u00e9lior\u00e9 et fait progresser les deux programmes propos\u00e9s par Centech aux entrepreneurs. J'ai pu constater son dynamisme, sa capacit\u00e9 d'\u00e9coute attentive et son engagement \u00e0 offrir un service de qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 ses clients. Je n'h\u00e9site pas un instant \u00e0 le recommander. Geoffrey ma\u00eetrise deux qualit\u00e9s essentielles : le savoir-faire et les comp\u00e9tences relationnelles."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":23.75,
                 "x":911,
                 "y":1191.75
                }, 
                {
                 "height":14.25,
                 "id":63,
                 "name":"Carl malartre",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"carl"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Working with Geoffrey at Centech was effective. I'm a startup coach. Things got done on time, communications were clear, leadership was there and improvements were implemented to provide better results to our clients and assistance to our coaches. I got support every time I needed it."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Travailler avec Geoffrey chez Centech s'est av\u00e9r\u00e9 tr\u00e8s efficace. Je suis coach en start-up. Les t\u00e2ches ont \u00e9t\u00e9 accomplies dans les d\u00e9lais, la communication \u00e9tait claire, le leadership \u00e9tait pr\u00e9sent et des am\u00e9liorations ont \u00e9t\u00e9 mises en place pour offrir de meilleurs r\u00e9sultats \u00e0 nos clients et un meilleur accompagnement \u00e0 nos coachs. J'ai re\u00e7u du soutien chaque fois que j'en ai eu besoin."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":25,
                 "x":1034.75,
                 "y":1188.25
                }, 
                {
                 "height":12.6666666666667,
                 "id":64,
                 "name":"Geoffrey",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"geoffrey"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Welcome to the lobby of my interactive CV.\nHere, you can explore my experience, education, hobbies, and what others say about me. I created this little \u201cvideo game CV\u201d to challenge myself and build something with AI, even though I had no coding background.\nSo yes, you might spot a bug or two along the way. That is part of the adventure. More than making something perfect, I wanted to learn by doing and become truly hands-on with AI rather than just reading articles about it.\nI hope you enjoy exploring. And if my profile catches your interest, or if you would like to hear more about this project and others, feel free to contact me at geoffrey.poincheval@gmail.com"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Bienvenue dans le hall d'accueil de mon CV interactif.\nIci, vous pouvez d\u00e9couvrir mon parcours professionnel, ma formation, mes loisirs et ce que les autres disent de moi. J'ai cr\u00e9\u00e9 ce petit \u00ab CV sous forme de jeu vid\u00e9o \u00bb pour me lancer un d\u00e9fi et cr\u00e9er quelque chose \u00e0 l'aide de l'IA, m\u00eame si je n'avais aucune exp\u00e9rience en programmation.\nAlors oui, vous risquez de tomber sur un ou deux bugs en chemin. Cela fait partie de l'aventure. Plus que de cr\u00e9er quelque chose de parfait, je voulais apprendre par la pratique et me familiariser v\u00e9ritablement avec l'IA plut\u00f4t que de me contenter de lire des articles \u00e0 ce sujet.\nJ'esp\u00e8re que vous appr\u00e9cierez cette exploration. Et si mon profil suscite votre int\u00e9r\u00eat, ou si vous souhaitez en savoir plus sur ce projet et d'autres, n'h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 me contacter \u00e0 l'adresse geoffrey.poincheval@gmail.com"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":14.6666666666665,
                 "x":1193,
                 "y":748.333333333333
                }, 
                {
                 "height":11,
                 "id":65,
                 "name":"Geoffrey",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"geoffreysport"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Welcome to the Hobbies Room.\nThere is not much to interact with here, but I wanted to share a little of who I am outside of work. As you can see, sports and nature play a big role in my life. This room reflects one of my dreams: living in a chalet near the mountains, with biking, trail running, climbing, and hiking always close by.\nBut I also love the other side of that life: the coziness of a cold winter day indoors, playing video games and building tools like the one you are exploring now."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Bienvenue dans la salle des Loisirs.\nIl n'y a pas grand-chose \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir ici, mais je voulais vous donner un petit aper\u00e7u de qui je suis en dehors du travail. Comme vous pouvez le voir, le sport et la nature occupent une place importante dans ma vie. Cette pi\u00e8ce refl\u00e8te l'un de mes r\u00eaves : vivre dans un chalet pr\u00e8s des montagnes, avec le v\u00e9lo, le trail, l'escalade et la randonn\u00e9e \u00e0 port\u00e9e de main.\nMais j'aime aussi l'autre facette de cette vie : le confort d'une journ\u00e9e d'hiver froide pass\u00e9e \u00e0 l'int\u00e9rieur, \u00e0 jouer \u00e0 des jeux vid\u00e9o et \u00e0 cr\u00e9er des outils comme celui que vous explorez en ce moment."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":16,
                 "x":471.666666666667,
                 "y":799
                }, 
                {
                 "height":15.6666666666666,
                 "id":66,
                 "name":"Geoffrey",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"geoffrey"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Welcome to the Education Room.\nBelow me, you will find my diplomas and certifications. As you can see, biology and science in general are fields close to my heart. I was especially drawn to neurobiology, which I truly loved studying. However, I did not picture myself spending my life in a lab, so I decided to move toward business with a Master\u2019s degree in Valorisation of Biotechnological Innovations. Since then, I have been driven by a deep interest in entrepreneurship, innovation, and technology. More recently, this curiosity led me to complete a European certification in machine learning."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Bienvenue dans la salle des Formation.\nVous trouverez ci-dessous mes dipl\u00f4mes et certifications. Comme vous pouvez le constater, la biologie et les sciences en g\u00e9n\u00e9ral sont des domaines qui me tiennent particuli\u00e8rement \u00e0 c\u0153ur. J'\u00e9tais particuli\u00e8rement attir\u00e9e par la neurobiologie, que j'adorais \u00e9tudier. Cependant, je ne me voyais pas passer ma vie dans un laboratoire, j'ai donc d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de m'orienter vers le monde des affaires en obtenant un master en valorisation des innovations biotechnologiques. Depuis lors, je suis anim\u00e9e par un int\u00e9r\u00eat profond pour l'entrepreneuriat, l'innovation et la technologie. Plus r\u00e9cemment, cette curiosit\u00e9 m'a amen\u00e9e \u00e0 obtenir une certification europ\u00e9enne en apprentissage automatique."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":18.3333333333333,
                 "x":1911.33333333333,
                 "y":774.666666666667
                }, 
                {
                 "height":9.4545454545455,
                 "id":67,
                 "name":"Geoffrey",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"geoffrey"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Welcome to the Experience Room.\nHere, you can explore my four most recent professional experiences. Over the past six years, I have worked in startup incubation and innovation programs, supporting more than 300 early-stage technology ventures. At Centech, one of the leading university-affiliated incubators in North America, I designed and managed acceleration programs that helped founders structure their strategy, connect with investors, and prepare for fundraising. I also managed cohorts of more than 40 companies, twice a year.\nIn addition, I provided direct coaching to student entrepreneurs in Alsace and founders in Normandy, and I gained 18 months of hands-on startup experience in Montr\u00e9al."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Bienvenue dans la salle des Exp\u00e9rience.\nVous trouverez ici mes quatre exp\u00e9riences professionnelles les plus r\u00e9centes. Au cours des six derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es, j\u2019ai travaill\u00e9 dans le domaine de l\u2019incubation de start-ups et des programmes d\u2019innovation, accompagnant plus de 300 entreprises technologiques en phase de d\u00e9marrage. Chez Centech, l\u2019un des principaux incubateurs universitaires d\u2019Am\u00e9rique du Nord, j\u2019ai con\u00e7u et g\u00e9r\u00e9 des programmes d\u2019acc\u00e9l\u00e9ration qui ont aid\u00e9 les fondateurs \u00e0 structurer leur strat\u00e9gie, \u00e0 entrer en contact avec des investisseurs et \u00e0 se pr\u00e9parer \u00e0 la lev\u00e9e de fonds. J\u2019ai \u00e9galement g\u00e9r\u00e9 des promotions de plus de 40 entreprises, deux fois par an.\nDe plus, j\u2019ai assur\u00e9 un accompagnement direct aupr\u00e8s d\u2019\u00e9tudiants entrepreneurs en Alsace et de fondateurs en Normandie, et j\u2019ai acquis 18 mois d\u2019exp\u00e9rience pratique dans le domaine des start-ups \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":16,
                 "x":1192.72727272727,
                 "y":395.818181818182
                }, 
                {
                 "height":12,
                 "id":71,
                 "name":"Geoffrey",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"geoffrey"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Welcome to the Feedback Room.\nHere, I have imagined a small afterwork gathering with people I have worked with. You can speak directly with them to discover what they have to say about me. Their dialogues are directly based on the recommendations they left on my LinkedIn profile. In the middle of the room, you will also find the recommendation letter from my most recent employer. If you would like to see more, you can also visit my LinkedIn profile."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Bienvenue dans la Salle des feedbacks.\nJ'ai imagin\u00e9 ici une petite r\u00e9union entre coll\u00e8gues apr\u00e8s le travail. Vous pouvez leur parler directement pour d\u00e9couvrir ce qu'ils ont \u00e0 dire \u00e0 mon sujet. Leurs dialogues s'inspirent directement des recommandations qu'ils ont laiss\u00e9es sur mon profil LinkedIn. Au centre de la pi\u00e8ce, vous trouverez \u00e9galement la lettre de recommandation de mon dernier employeur. Si vous souhaitez en savoir plus, vous pouvez \u00e9galement consulter mon profil LinkedIn."
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":15.6363636363637,
                 "x":1193.45454545455,
                 "y":1257.81818181818
                }, 
                {
                 "height":12.5,
                 "id":72,
                 "name":"Geoffrey",
                 "properties":[
                        {
                         "name":"portrait",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"geoffrey"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_en",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Oh ! I didn't expected you to reach this room !\nIf you did, you might be as curious as I am, let's discover what else we share by contacting me at geoffrey.poincheval@gmail.com"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"text_fr",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"Oh ! Je ne m'attendais pas \u00e0 ce que tu arrives jusqu'\u00e0 cette pi\u00e8ce !\nSi c'est le cas, tu es peut-\u00eatre aussi curieux que moi. D\u00e9couvrons ce que nous avons d'autre en commun en me contactant \u00e0 l'adresse geoffrey.poincheval@gmail.com"
                        }, 
                        {
                         "name":"type",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"character"
                        }],
                 "rotation":0,
                 "type":"character",
                 "visible":true,
                 "width":19.5,
                 "x":2503.5,
                 "y":1550
                }],
